nd synchronize them with the LLM. This ensures that the chatbot always has access to the most recent company information, delivering dynamic, up-to-date responses to any visitor enquiry.</span></p>\n","clientName":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">emQube LLC, a software solution house and digital content studio based in Dubai.</span></p>\n","companyInfo":null,"keyBenefitsList":null,"projectCaseStudyFile":null,"technologyLogos":[{"altText":"Google Vertex AI","mediaItemUrl":"https://wp.emqube.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Google-Vertex-AI-1x.webp"}],"testimonialAuthor":"Sales Manager","testimonialContent":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Integrating a GenAI interface on our homepage has completely changed how visitors interact with our brand. It provides instant, conversational answers to our services, keeping our information current with zero maintenance effort.</span></p>\n"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"cG9zdDo3NDE1"}},"staticQueryHashes":["3649515864"],"slicesMap":{"footer":"footer","navigation-bar":"navigation-bar"}}